        "original_id": "47612f28-8a45-5792-9d8b-0cf11d95b5b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: El Nuevo Cojo Ilustrado, Golf Magazine\n- Places: Los Angeles, California, United States\n- Companies: Time Inc., Universal Publishing and Distributing, Times Mirror\n- Topics: Spanish-language media, Venezuelan culture, golf media\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Magazine was started in April 1959 by Universal Publishing and Distributing.\n- Times Mirror bought Golf Magazine from Universal Publishing and Distributing in 1972.\n- Golf Magazine is a monthly golf magazine owned by Time Inc.\n- El Nuevo Cojo Ilustrado is an American online Spanish-language magazine published from Los Angeles, California.\n- El Nuevo Cojo Ilustrado originally was an arts and opinion magazine focused exclusively on Venezuelan culture for Venezuelans living in the United States.",
